  m_text: "<size=120%><b>EQUIPO DEL PROYECTO</b></size>\n\nLider de proyecto - Andres
    Moya\nProgramador - Alejandro Sandoval\nDise\xF1adora UI/UX - Sara Santos\nModelador
    3D - william Cubillos\nTester/Documentador - Lowell Ortiz\n\n<size=120%><b>PARQUE</b></size>\n\r\nReinaldo
    Di Pietro - ROCK MODELS KIT - GAME READY\r\nBull studios - Way Path Blocks\r\ncerura
    vinula - Low poly assets\r\ngauravnikam - Low poly Water Fountain\r\n\r\n<size=120%><b>ARCADE</b></size>\n\r\nCosimo
    - Air Hockey Table\r\nalejan.ria18 - Arcade Retro\r\nCaptain Allen - Golden Freddy
    (FNaF HW) [MODEL EDIT]\r\nMToonGameStudio - Spring Bonnie [Low Poly]\r\nAspectStudios
    -  Lowpoly Arcade Machine\r\nwessel.huizenga - Piano (low poly)\r\nAkio - Drum
    set with Blender armature\r\n3D Bear - Electric guitar lowpoly model\r\nDimitri
    - Low Poly Pizza\r\nVictoria Reinhold - Dance Dance Revolution\r\nTampaJoey -
